- Specs are vitest describe/it/expect in test/, importing the module from '../src/...'. Review only the codeline the story targets; a diff touching files outside PROJECT ROOT is a major issue.
- Commands, run in the codeline root: `npm test` (vitest run) executes the suite; `npm run build` is the type-check (tsc --noEmit). tsconfig sets strict: true and includes both src and test, so test files must type-check too. `npm run lint` is a stub that echoes "no-lint-configured" — a passing lint is evidence of nothing.
